# uuid Risk Acceptance — Steps

1. In Vanta, open the vulnerability task ([app.vanta.com](https://app.vanta.com) → Tests → "Medium vulnerabilities identified in packages are addressed (GitHub Repo)" → uuid finding `GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq`); mark Risk Accepted, set re-evaluation 2026-11-15, paste the acceptance note.
   - This is the policy-mandated artifact per Operations Security Policy line 100 — vulnerabilities past the standard remediation timeline must record a risk-acceptance plan on the ticket itself.

2. Create a new entry in the Vanta [Risk Register](https://app.eu.vanta.com/c/normain.com/risk-management/risk-register) (called "Risk scenarios" in Vanta) — click **Add scenario**: treatment Accept, owner Kalle, approver Sara, next review 2026-11-15; link it to the vulnerability task from step 1.
   - The Risk Register is the canonical ISMS artifact per the Risk Management Policy. One row per accepted risk, reviewed at every Management Review.

3. Ping Sara on Slack or email so she comments approval on the Vanta task; once she signs off, fill in the approval date in both the task note and the Register entry.
   - Sara is the Security Delegate; her sign-off is required by the Operations Security Policy → Exceptions clause.

4. Move the [existing Google Doc](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ojoDY1Acg4oqVvt9eYA6FGhPzvsh8tHjsD53OceReDU/edit) to Trash.
   - The Drive Doc is redundant under this path — Vanta is the system of record. Sara's commenter permission auto-revokes when the Doc is trashed.

5. Edit the [2026-11-15 calendar event](https://www.google.com/calendar/event?eid=aGZyODI5MW1wbDk3ZWI2bWJ0NTZtaDJxNTgga2FsbGVAbm9ybWFpbi5jb20) "Re-evaluate uuid risk acceptance — GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq" and replace the Drive Doc URL in the description with the Vanta task and Risk Register URLs.
   - The reminder needs to point at the live artifacts, not the trashed Doc.

6. Add a line to the next Q3 2026 ISMS Management Review agenda (in [00 - ISMS](https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MPx1BiRUNNHmMzOX3HLTQ2bv-4LESp5l)) under "Open vulnerabilities".
   - Suggested wording: "uuid GHSA-w5hq-g745-h8pq — risk-accepted YYYY-MM-DD, next review 2026-11-15. See Vanta Risk Register."
